msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT2_VOLT_PIN <BATT2_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = **13**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:61
#: 0dd1823ef5ca4db5928ec1dcd0202c1c 8a659d6446434fe49345842d4fdd7e7e
#: c4b47d1657de4c6b9a762e916844969a cab396af934845698b18a65a2bb676a9
msgid ":ref:`BATT2_CURR_PIN <BATT2_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = **14**"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT2_CURR_PIN <BATT2_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = **14**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:63
#: 209f5233b65b48e998fe5106a9199760 3335db6c6c6c4eaab998bfd14836bf5a
#: d9521e1e34384dc68847cb2bcc902810 e8e07c68e4e34c6e9a13e3434cefef34
msgid ""
"The :ref:`BATT2_VOLT_MULT <BATT2_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` and "
":ref:`BATT2_AMP_PERVLT <BATT2_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` should "
"also be set by comparing the reported values vs values collected using a "
"hand held voltage meter"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT2_VOLT_MULT <BATT2_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 和 "
":ref:`BATT2_AMP_PERVLT <BATT2_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` "
"应通过与手持电压表测量值对比来校准设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:70
#: 0462209b29cd4ec080e5e3b2f10bfa35 39a7034bcc184780b6415b16122378d7
#: 66ead74e996940789ea5f93ca28282ad ec253b6dd65b4854b1b2d9ea426eee31
msgid "Failsafe"
msgstr "失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:73
#: 5dd4058e69784ea0a7485e21446862d8
msgid ""
"Instructions for :ref:`battery failsafe can be found here <failsafe-"
"battery>`"
msgstr ":ref:`电池失控保护说明见此 <failsafe-battery>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:77
#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:79
#: 5e27f09b3b7045688be0421ab88aafaa 747d4e21324c4ed089fb5457bac3a966
#: b6962b38dddb4a1fb4450fc91d010c41 c4e391fad89b46a0a96909f31c0915c0
msgid "Extending Current Measurement Capacity"
msgstr "扩展电流测量范围"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:79
#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:81
#: 04e181e10bf84c84b0666304dd9cb274 1cfcaca684324e7483ccb908b8fb8676
#: 585abaca549447609c6717be005aab81 e71272eae3894d29ae1550b60f7404a6
msgid ""
"Shunt resistor power monitors of this variety can be used to measure higher "
"currents if setup in a current sharing configuration, as shown below:"
msgstr "此类分流电阻电源监测器可通过电流分流配置来测量更大电流，如下图所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:84
#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:86
#: 01fb3c12f7ca4a0383a8bc3b37db98f0 4b592f0c10a840f6a4a3408a2f431829
#: 69bcfe17095d418a8e5487f54199f589 fc603df0aad447248bd9b4c19c2ca607
msgid "Design points:"
msgstr "设计要点："

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:86
#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:88
#: 0cf297c972b946b39731e1febd34162a 14dcfeaf934149109c98711b23449891
#: 7bf316871c804c2b85df0b2c342c53b1 a6e49413ed114f209006871867e4c26d
msgid ""
"The shunt should be approximately the same resistance as the power module. "
"For example, a 120A module usually uses a 0.5 milliohm sense resistor. "
"Therefore the wire shunt should be ~ 0.5 milliohm for equal sharing of the "
"total current. This can be determined from a reference such as `this "
"<https://www.engineeringtoolbox.com/wire-gauges-d_419.html>`_ . For 12ga "
"wire, that would be ~ 4 inches."
msgstr ""
"分流线应与电源模块的电阻大致相同。例如，120A 模块通常使用 0.5 毫欧感应电阻，因此分流线阻值应约为 0.5 毫欧以实现电流均分。可参考 `此表 "
"<https://www.engineeringtoolbox.com/wire-gauges-d_419.html>`_ 确定。对于 12 号线，约 "
"4 英寸。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:87
#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:89
#: 143ad81f0bbc42618e624b8c93030e5f 1b6b0e7574fc4eeab93c0e2df0db85d7
#: 8e4a4301fe884f719321929eb3fe9fb1 fc0fc049f3e54f66a9b43d1bd7c0d79c
msgid ""
"The wire gauge (and, of course, the wire used to connect the power module) "
"should be rated to handle the expected continuous current for the length of "
"wiring utilized."
msgstr "导线规格（以及连接电源模块所用导线）应能承受所用线长下的预期持续电流。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:88
#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:90
#: 063d53d69e7c4b5b8fb450a9953783de 998a06f978364d6399b1aace8443bae9
#: a386f5bc97a54e1f945532bc46c2877d bf6199679f7c4bcdb736b48d41a00224
msgid ""
"Try to keep the leads from the shunt junctions to power module short. Longer"
" leads to the module there will increase resistance in that branch. This "
"will unbalance the current split. Not an large issue, but will effectively "
"increase the max resistance capability and decrease the incremental "
"sensitivity of the measurement more than needed."
msgstr ""
"尽量缩短分流节点到电源模块的引线长度。较长的引线会增加该支路阻值，导致电流分配不均。这不是大问题，但会有效增大最大可测电阻值，并降低测量精度超过所需程度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:94
#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:96
#: 51c9efb4649943158d4685994f435ebf 627fb35d780141408ddab66901d08a7f
#: 71927f67717d43899ed7f68308aa730d 900e453a2a5c40369d8ba11a12f5bd74
msgid ""
"In the photo above, by providing two bypasses, the current is shared such "
"that the power monitor sees a little less than 1/3 the total current "
"flowing, and reports a value ~1/3 normal, extending its range ~3X."
msgstr "上图中通过提供两条旁路，使电流分配为电源监测器仅检测到总电流的略低于 1/3，报告值约为正常值的 1/3，将量程扩展约 3 倍。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:96
#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:98
#: 03f40782cdfb446798bd06875ef26173 6098f9cf55ca4cc4b860087249738371
#: 8b3e67ac2f4b4ddd9794ddda8947b4a8 c41b0c0396ed474e8c7de3bc5be1953b
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Due to variations in materials, length, etc. it is mandatory that the "
"monitor be calibrated using a precision current meter of some kind. It is "
"best to calibrate at a value greater than 50% of the maximum current "
"expected."
msgstr "由于材料、长度等因素存在差异，必须使用某种精密电流计对监测器进行校准。最好在高于预期最大电流 50% 的电流值下进行校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:74
